  "mach:judgementReason": "The de-facto standard for clinical variant calling. GATK Best Practices pipelines are the reference methodology for germline and somatic variant discovery in clinical genomics labs globally. 1,900+ stars, Apache-2.0, Docker-distributed, Cromwell/WDL compatible. Used in the 100,000 Genomes Project, clinical diagnostic labs, and most large-scale genomics programmes. No credible open-source alternative matches its breadth and validation in clinical settings.",
